      en: ["The theatre was officially inaugurated on December 1, 1971.", "It features monumental murals by artists Roberto Huezo and Carlos Cañas.", "The seating capacity of the main auditorium is exactly 1,429.", "It serves as the permanent home for the National Symphony Orchestra of El Salvador.", "The building was designed by the architect Roberto Dadaglio in a modernist style.", "It is the primary venue for international classical music festivals in the country."],
